  "topology": "   [SW1] Gi0/1 ════════ Gi0/1 [SW2]\n         Gi0/2 ════════ Gi0/2\n\n  SW2 is ready: Gi0/1-2 in channel-group 1 mode passive,\n  Port-channel1 trunking with native VLAN 99.",
